<%#
  The two panels a composition change touches, and nothing else.

  Adding or removing an item changes the composition AND the bench (a topic gains
  or loses its "Added" mark), but not the player and not the transcript — and
  re-sending those would cost ~940KB and tear down the YouTube iframe, restarting
  playback on every click. So the reply carries the two panels instead of a page.
%>
<%= turbo_stream.replace "cut_topics" do %><%= render "topics" %><% end %>
<%= turbo_stream.replace "cut_composition" do %><%= render "cut" %><% end %>
